[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="Skill" load_steps=2 format=3]

; Energy Accelerator primary — "Accelerator". Hold LMB for a continuous
; cone-shaped stream of damage. Resource drains continuously; tick rate
; is fast (~8 ticks/sec) so per-tick damage feels smooth rather than
; stair-stepped. Damage type (flame / cryo / electric) is rolled onto
; the weapon, not the skill — the LMB stream just deals weapon damage;
; status effects only fire on the RMB Overcharge.

